# Netlist gate: every cache RAM inside the nested generate loops must have its
# clock connected.  The SAT miter is VACUOUS here (an undriven clock reads as
# constant 0 on the gate side and the proof still passes), so gate on
# `check -assert` of the flattened design: without the fix the four RAM cells
# report "Port clk has empty connection" and check finds 4 undriven clk wires.
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top gen_scope_iface_member_clk_actual
proc; flatten; opt_clean
check -assert
